        {
          "text": "Aga hu' mina ga v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Esau ku' muki' wakwe Oholibama, mwana wamwa Ana, u'yo wav'age mwizu'ku'lu' wamwa Sibeoni: V'itanagwe Yeushi, Yalamu na Kola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
