          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kola, Gatamu na Amaleki. V'enav'a v'av'age hu' v'ahanya, ki'la yu'mo mu igongo lyakwe kwenu'ko ku' nsi' ya Edomu. V'enav'a v'ose v'av'age v'ana v'amwa Elifazi, mwana wamwa Ada.",
          "type": "text",
