        {
          "text": "Aga hu' mina ga v'ana v'amwa Leueli, mwana wamwa Esau: V'itanagwe Nahati, Zela, Shama na Miza. V'enav'a v'av'age hu' v'ahanya, ki'la yu'mo mu igongo lyakwe kwenu'ko ku' nsi' ya Edomu. V'enav'a hu' v'av'yalwa v'amwa Leueli, mwana wamwa Basemati, muki' wamwa Esau.",
          "type": "text",
